---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="页面未找到 | 老机复活" description="抱歉，您访问的页面不存在。您可能输入了错误的网址或页面已被移动。" currentPath="/404" noindex={true}>
    <section class="page-view">
        <div class="section-container text-center" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 4rem auto; padding: 2rem 1rem;">
            <div style="font-size: 6rem; line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 16px rgba(46, 125, 50, 0.15)); text-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);">🔌</div>
            <h1 class="view-title" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">404 - 链接已断开</h1>
            <p class="view-subtitle" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
                糟糕！此处的线缆似乎被拔掉了，或者这个复活方案目前不可达。请检查网址是否正确输入，或返回首页。
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center;">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">返回首页</a>
                <a href="/blog" class="btn btn-secondary">查看复活日记</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
